        "original_id": "13bd6a4c-b52b-58bb-a198-49d0223a74d8",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Alex Wyse, Jessica Stroup, Matt Long\n- Products: Iron Fist, The Bold and the Beautiful, Spring Awakening, The Defenders, 90210, The Following, Homecoming\n- Concepts: Marvel Cinematic Universe\n\nFacts:\n- Jessica Leigh Stroup was born on October 23, 1986, and she is an American actress.\n- In 2009, the film Homecoming follows a student couple, Mike, played by Matt Long, and Elizabeth, played by Jessica Stroup, during their homecoming.\n- In 2015, Alex Wyse played Georg Zirschnitz in the Deaf West Broadway revival of Spring Awakening.\n- Alex Wyse is best known for playing Kyle in Iron Fist and Saul Feinberg in The Bold and the Beautiful.\n- Iron Fist is set in the Marvel Cinematic Universe and shares continuity with the franchise's films.\n- Iron Fist is the fourth in a series of shows that lead to The Defenders crossover miniseries.\n- Jessica Stroup is best known for her roles as Erin Silver on 90210, Max Hardy on The Following, and Joy Meachum in Iron Fist.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
